    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206060/extras/cd47e9e21affbf9bd9c398c08e7faab4.poster.avif?t=1743605763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206060/extras/cd47e9e21affbf9bd9c398c08e7faab4.webm?t=1743605763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206060/extras/cd47e9e21affbf9bd9c398c08e7faab4.mp4?t=1743605763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>A little boy falls asleep to a horrible nightmare. Can you make him happy again?</i><br><br>- Brand new psychedelic horror adventure from the creators of Botanicula and CHUCHEL<br>- Endure and escape three unforgettable nightmares<br>- Solve deeply disturbing puzzles in (not so) charming environments<br>- Deal with suspicious smiley faces and pink bunnies<br>- Creepy songs and screeches from the Czech freakfolk band DVA",
